#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""sls-slsm-mcp - MCP server bridging sls and slsm CLIs.

A stdio MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that exposes sls (system log
search) and slsm (SLS memory / error pattern playbook) as tools for
Claude Code and other MCP-compatible AI coding agents.

Requires:
  - sls  (https://github.com/krasmussen37/sls)
  - slsm (https://github.com/krasmussen37/sls-memory)
  - Python 3.7+

No external Python dependencies.
"""

